From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 18:40:28 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] MdeModulePkg: Add Auto Boot Fall-Through option

[ouroBIOS: commit 6c14abf865e0 of MrChromebox's edk2, as it is]

A failed automatic BootOrder attempt always waited for a key, so a
missing removable device blocked later entries. Add an NVRAM setting
next to Auto Boot Time-out that, when enabled (the default), continues
to the next BootOrder entry without prompting. Manual selections from
the boot menu, a hotkey, or BootNext still show the failure prompt.

Signed-off-by: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
